[FIXED] Shift + right click in an inventory should allow for stashing of multiple items, as with selling.
    GIVE / STASH / DROP: shift for ten, right-click for ten, shift+right-click for the whole
    stack. Button tooltips say so.

[FIXED] The labor skill grows way too quickly. It should be a more gradual increase. And it shouldn’t allow for such speed in harvesting – it’s a bit unbalanced currently.
    Labour was the fastest skill in the game to cap — about eleven minutes of one hand on a
    woodpile — because its own reward is a faster work cycle, so it paid itself. It earns at
    55% of the old rate now and tapers as it rises. The harvest bonus went from linear (six
    times speed at cap) to a root curve (three times at cap, and the first twenty-five points
    still buy a full doubling).


